# Admin (AdminJS)

Read [docs/apps/admin.md](../../docs/apps/admin.md) first.

## Layout

- `apps/admin/src/index.ts` — AdminJS bootstrap, resource definitions, auth, role checks
- `apps/admin/src/database.ts` — Sequelize instance with model list
- `apps/admin/src/components/` — custom AdminJS React components (`Login`, `Dashboard`)
- ESM package (`"type": "module"`); use `.js` extensions in local imports

## Data access

- Import models from `@coolestprojects/database`
- Direct MySQL via Sequelize — does **not** call `apps/api` over HTTP
- DB config from env (`DB_*`) via `@nestjs/config` `ConfigService`

## Roles

Defined in `index.ts`:

- `superadmin` — full access
- `admin` — event-scoped resources (`currentAdmin.eventId`)
- `judge` — voting dashboard and own votes

Use `addEventFilter`, `canCreate`, `canAccessResourceFieldFilter`, `andAccess` helpers for event scoping.

## AdminJS patterns

- `@adminjs/sequelize` adapter for resources
- `@adminjs/passwords` for `Account` password hashing
- `ComponentLoader` for custom components; override `Login`, add `Dashboard`
- Custom components are `.tsx` files referenced by path in `componentLoader`
- Do not commit `apps/admin/.adminjs/` — AdminJS regenerates `entry.js` and `bundle.js` on start

## After model changes

Rebuild database package and restart admin dev server.
